  "reasoning": "The defendant purchased a large number of disabled persons' personal data and used it to impersonate civil affairs officials, deceiving victims into transferring money. This constitutes fraud (诈骗) because he obtained property by false pretenses. Additionally, the act of illegally obtaining and using personal information is a separate offense under Chinese law (非法获取公民个人信息罪). Therefore, the appropriate charges are fraud and illegal acquisition of personal information.",
